  "details": "Recently, VRChat has been causing hard crashes of my entire system.\n\nI have not isolated any sort of pattern and it is impossible to gather logs because it is a hard crash of the entire system.\n\nMy computer only crashes with VRChat. I confirmed that all my settings are correct, I don't have any overclocking settings, and ran various stress tests with benchmarks and different games. BIOS is fully updated, drivers updated, etc. I also have tried turning off specific software I have running in case those would cause crashes (like NZXT CAM, etc.)\n\nThis has happened for the past few months and has increased ever since I got my 5700X3D. It will crash even when the system is barely under load and I am frame-capped at 72. \n\nSystem Specs:\n\n- ASRock X570M Pro4\n\n- Ryzen 5700X3D\n\n- EVGA RTX 3080\n\n- EVGA B2 750W\n\n- 128 GB (4x32 GB) 3200 Mhz CL16 Corsair Vengeance LPX",
